    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00960",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "下礼拜是红叶季节，又够忙的了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Next week is the autumn foliage season, so it will be terribly busy again.",
          "g": "predicate"
