    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00960",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "谢谢你。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Thank you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00960",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "驹子一边梳理散开了的头发，一边仰起脸来，甜滋滋地抿嘴笑了起来，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As Komako combed her loosened hair, she lifted her face and smiled sweetly with her lips closed.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
