    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00960",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "“管它呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Never mind that.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00960",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "嘻嘻嘻，多可笑啊。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hee hee hee, how funny.",
